L0007: Unknown string escape

The string contains an escape sequence the lexer does not support. Use a supported escape such as \n, \t, \\ or \"; for a literal backslash, escape the backslash itself.

Example from `tests/corpus/reject/bad_escape.lc`; the full file is a regression test.

```locus
// An escape Rust does not have.
fn greeting() -> u8 {
    "a\qb"
}
```

Language, as built: [1.0:2](../../atlas.html#/doc/language/spec-1.0:2).
